Third-party notices for Anole
=============================

Anole is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). It is built from the components below.
Nothing in this list is vendored into this repository: each package is
fetched by `zig build` from the pinned URL in build.zig.zon. Most packages
keep their own licence file, but the zio and dusty packages ship no LICENSE
(their build.zig.zon .paths leave it out), so this file carries their
notices: the copyright lines in part A and the MIT text in part C. Files in
this repository that adapt third-party code carry an attribution header and
are listed in part B.

Which components end up in a binary depends on the build flags:
`-Dprofile=minimal` links only zio, dusty and llhttp; `-Dtls=boringssl` adds
BoringSSL; `-Dhttp2` adds nghttp2; `-Dhttp3` adds ngtcp2 and nghttp3.


